<section id="view-topics" class="view topic-index" aria-labelledby="topicIndexTitle">
  <div class="topic-index-inner">
    <header class="topic-index-header">
      <h1 id="topicIndexTitle" tabindex="-1">전체 주제</h1>
      <p>지금 고민에 맞는 상담과 사주 서비스를 찾아보세요.</p>
    </header>
    <nav class="topic-index-shortcuts" aria-label="주제 바로가기"></nav>
    <div class="topic-index-groups">
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group='[data-story-topic="love"],[aria-labelledby="directoryRelationshipsTitle"] .directory-card'>
        <h2 tabindex="-1">연애·궁합</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group='[data-story-topic="wealth"],[data-story-topic="career"],[aria-labelledby="directoryCareerTitle"] .directory-card'>
        <h2 tabindex="-1">일·재물</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group='[aria-labelledby="directoryStudyTitle"] .directory-card'>
        <h2 tabindex="-1">학업·성장</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group='[aria-labelledby="directoryLifeTitle"] .directory-card'>
        <h2 tabindex="-1">생활·관계</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group='[data-story-topic="wedding"],[aria-labelledby="directoryDatesTitle"] .directory-card'>
        <h2 tabindex="-1">중요한 결정</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group=".directory-year-preview">
        <h2 tabindex="-1">신년상담</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="topic-index-group" data-topic-group='[aria-labelledby="directoryFeaturedTitle"] .directory-feature'>
        <h2 tabindex="-1">사주 리포트</h2>
        <ul></ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
